              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au mmahianyi akabanyabo kudi Eleazâ muakuidi, ne kudi Yoshua, muana wa Nuna, ne kudi bakadi ku mutu kua bisamba bia Bena Isalele, hakelabo nshobo mu Shilo, ku mpala kua Yehowa, ku mbelu kua ntenta wa kutendelelamu. Nunku bakashikisha kuabanya buloba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.51",
